WHY THIS LICENSE

The data here is derived in part from FTN Data charting, distributed through
nflverse under CC BY-SA 4.0. That license carries a ShareAlike obligation, so
adaptations of it are released under the same license. This repository honours
that by using CC BY-SA 4.0 itself.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

Share and adapt these files, for any purpose including commercially, provided
you:

  - give appropriate credit (see the attribution section of README.md),
  - indicate what changes you made,
  - and license your version under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well.

ATTRIBUTION FOR THE UNDERLYING DATA

Attribution for the charting data must be made to "ftndata.com via nflverse".
Full source credits are listed in README.md.

STATEMENT OF MODIFICATIONS

These files are derived data, not raw nflverse data. The "Modifications"
section of README.md describes what was changed, as CC BY-SA 4.0 requires.

NO WARRANTY

Provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. These figures include model
output and should not be treated as official NFL statistics.
